  "id": "ludiomil",
  "term": "Ludiomil",
  "definition": "Ludiomil is a brand name for maprotiline hydrochloride, an antidepressant in the tetracyclic group that is closely related to tricyclic antidepressants. It works by blocking the reuptake of norepinephrine in the central nervous system, which raises its level at nerve synapses, and it also has sedative effects.",
